OL,3,GNEWSANurse said dementia patient
OL,4,A'didn't need birthday cake'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home nurse has been struck off
OL,7,Fafter claiming a resident with dementia
OL,8,Fdid not need a cake because they would
OL,9,Fnot be aware it was their birthday.
OL,11,FRossitsa Petkova was found guilty of
OL,12,Fmisconduct by a Nursing and Midwifery
OL,13,FCouncil (NMC) Panel, and banned her
OL,14,Ffrom the profession.
OL,16,FThe incident took place at Castleford
OL,17,FHouse Nursing Home in Tutshill,
OL,18,FGloucestershire, close to the border
OL,19,Fwith Wales, where she had worked as a
OL,20,Fregistered nurse for more than a
OL,21,Fdecade.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
